       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEST-REL0001A.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY COPY002A.
       01 N PIC 99.
       01 I PIC 99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INITIALIZE COPY002A-REGISTRO
           ACCEPT N
           MOVE N TO COPY002A-QUANT-REG
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N
           MOVE I TO COPY002A-COD(I)
           MOVE 'Ana' TO COPY002A-NOME(I)
           MOVE 25 TO COPY002A-IDADE(I)
           MOVE 01012000 TO COPY002A-DATA-NASC(I)
           MOVE 'Dev' TO COPY002A-CARGO(I)
           MOVE 'a@example.com' TO COPY002A-EMAIL(I)
           MOVE 123456789 TO COPY002A-TELEFONE(I)
           MOVE 'Rua Um' TO COPY002A-RUA(I)
           MOVE 'Cidade' TO COPY002A-CIDADE(I)
           MOVE 'SP' TO COPY002A-ESTADO(I)
           MOVE 12345678 TO COPY002A-CEP(I)
           END-PERFORM
           CALL 'REL0001A' USING COPY002A-REGISTRO
           DISPLAY 'COUNT:' COPY002A-QUANT-REG
           DISPLAY 'RC:' RETURN-CODE
           STOP RUN.
